Package: MixedDeepMM
Type: Package
Title: Deep Mixture Models for Continuous and Mixed-Type Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jinran", "Wu", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jinran.wu@uq.edu.au"),
    person("Geoffrey J.", "McLachlan", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Fits Gaussian, Student-t and skew-t deep mixture models to
    continuous observations, and single-head and two-head latent mixture
    models to combinations of continuous, binary, ordinal, nominal and count
    measurements. Mixed-response estimation uses Monte Carlo expectation-
    maximisation with structured data-derived initialisation. Utilities for
    posterior clustering, Gower dissimilarity, silhouette evaluation,
    adjusted Rand index and misclassification rate are provided. Original deep Gaussian mixture models
    are described by Viroli and McLachlan (2019)
    <doi:10.1007/s11222-017-9793-z>.
